  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to International Service for Human Rights 2021-2023</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to promote recognition and protection of human rights defenders (HRD) in developing countries by strengthening the capacity of HRDs to make use of global and regional human rights mechanisms, and to strengthen international and regional standards and systems to protect HRDs, and support national implementation of these norms. Women, LGBTIQ and environmental HRDs are among ISHRs priority groups.</narrative>
  </description>
